# label: alg:ch91-free
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch91.tex:24
# caption: Collect the free declaration identities needed by a closure.

REQUIRE resolved syntax and parameter/local binding identities
ENSURE exactly the references supplied by the enclosing environment
traverse the body, maintaining the set of locally bound declarations
FORALL variable references DO
  IF reference is not locally bound THEN
    add its declaration identity to captures
  END IF
END FOR
include bindings needed by nested closures that are constructed here
return captures in a deterministic layout order

